  (text "PINOUT NOTES\nJ1/J2 retain the MC68008P physical pin numbers. Socket symbols use passive pins.\nA0-A19 and D0-D7; one DS strobe; IPL1 + combined IPL2/IPL0.\nTwo-wire BR/BG arbitration: no BGACK. No VMA output on this variant.\nJ1 plug footprint, bottom-view orientation and socket clearance remain to be selected."
    (at 20.32 210.82 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "4375100d-21f5-5562-9641-1039c68e3071"))
  (text "POWER INTENT\n+5V comes from motherboard pin 13 and powers\nthe physical CPU and AHCT bus drivers. USB VBUS stays separate.\nBoard power comes exclusively from this target rail; USB has no power path."
    (at 231.14 210.82 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "974505e3-f64a-5a94-aa80-b9df23666d17"))
